{"id":"wb-6-588","name":"漳州林氏宗祠","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"漳州林氏宗祠","text":"漳州林氏宗祠位于中国福建省漳州市芗城区振成巷，是漳州七县林氏宗族合建的大宗祠，因林氏尊比干为始祖，故又称比干庙，2006年被列为第六批全国重点文物保护单位。\n林氏宗祠始建年代不详，现存四方殿（大殿）和东侧回廊，为明代建筑。四方殿为抬梁与穿斗共存的木构建筑，面阔三间，进深五间，重檐歇山顶，具有宋元时期的建筑风格。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%BC%B3%E5%B7%9E%E6%9E%97%E6%B0%8F%E5%AE%97%E7%A5%A0","revisionId":86563531,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86563531","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/57dc6c5232a83b2326a11616.jpg","title":"Zhangzhou_Linshi_Zongci_20120225-2.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Zhangzhou_Linshi_Zongci_20120225-2.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/35/Zhangzhou_Linshi_Zongci_20120225-2.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Zhangzhugang","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​漳州林氏宗祠，位于中国福建省漳州市，是全国重点文物保护单位。","width":320,"height":213}}